Copyright and licensing status of fugazi.db
=============================================

This package has no general open-source license grant over its data
content, pending resolution of the copyright question below.

Source of the data
-------------------

The data in this package - show dates, venues, attendance, setlists, and
any free-text notes (e.g. `fls_data$fls_notes`) - is sourced from the
Fugazi Live Series website (https://www.dischord.com/fugazi_live_series),
which is copyright Dischord Records.

The package maintainer requested permission from Dischord Records to
redistribute this data openly; as of this package's current version, that
request is still pending a reply. Until that is resolved, this data is not
released under an open-source or open-data license, and the copyright
holder of the underlying source data is Dischord Records, not the package
maintainer.

Cleaning, correction (e.g. venue geocoding, spelling fixes), and
re-organization of the raw data into the tables shipped here is original
work by the package maintainer, Alex Mitrani.

Questions about reuse should be directed to the package maintainer (see
DESCRIPTION) and, for the underlying source data itself, to Dischord
Records.
